  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ecba408d05f40b68f07429a1adb4599, type: 3}
  m_Name: NpcDialogueSO
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcDialogueSO
  _meetText:
  - Shift's over. Got my ore quota. Let me return home.
  - It's freezing out here. My lamp burned out a few hours ago...
  - I finished my haul. My... family is waiting for me in the lower bunker.
  - Don't just stand there staring! Open the elevator.
  - Greetings, operator. I have completed the assigned surface mining duties.
  - We got separated in Shaft B. The others... didn't make it. Just open up.
  - Check my identification if you want, just pull the lever! Something was following
    me.
  - Let me in NOW!
  _acceptText:
  - Thank God... I thought I was going to freeze out here.
  - Appreciate it. I need some rest.
  - Step aside, I need to drop this haul.
  - Safe at last.
  - Thank you.
  - 'You made the right choice. '
  - THANK YOU. THANK YOU. THANK YOU.
  _rejectText:
  - I have a family, you can't leave me here!
  - No! Wait! Check my ID again! That scratch on my pants isn't from them!
  - You're locking me out?! The surface frost will kill me in five minutes!
  - I'm human! Look at me! Look into my eyes! I'm NOT one of them!
  - Please... my daughter is waiting for me... don't do this to me!
  - OPEN THE DOOR! THEY'RE RIGHT BEHIND ME! OPEN THE DAMN DOOR!
  - You coward! I'll crawl my way down there, I'm coming for you!
  - I HAVE A FAMILY I HAVE A FAMILY I HAVE A FAMILY--
  - Yooooouuuu'lllll regreet thaat.
